7-
8-## Items belong inside their group
9-
10:- `hlm-select-item` goes inside `hlm-select-content` (and optionally `hlm-select-group`).
11-- `button[hlmToggleGroupItem]` goes inside `hlm-toggle-group`.
12-- `button[hlmTabsTrigger]` goes inside `hlm-tabs-list`.
13-- Accordion: `hlm-accordion-trigger` and `hlm-accordion-content` go inside `hlm-accordion-item`,
14-  which goes inside `hlm-accordion`.
15-
16-## Overlays need a title
17-
18-Dialog, Sheet, and Alert Dialog must have a title for accessibility. If the design hides it, keep it
19-present and apply `class="sr-only"`.
20-
21-```html
22-<hlm-dialog>
